  "_comment": "Replaces the counting-trivia generator that asked how many edges an n-gonal pyramid has. The one-third factor is the mistake this family exists to test, so every mode carries a distractor that omits it. Python/SymPy owns generation, mathematics, validation and distractor filtering; Jinja only renders prepared question data.",
  "tag": {
